DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41319::$$$message_0276_0000_0000$$$::"The great gods of the shrine,[br]if various disasters and bad or impure events were to happen,[br]we graciously ask you to remove and purify us." ::
41320::$$$message_0276_0001_0000$$$::"Welcome to Tohsaka Shrine.[br]Here, I will teach you the proper worship etiquette of this shrine."::
41321::$$$message_0276_0002_0000$$$::"It is important to cleanse your body so you do not appear rude before the gods. Of course your worship etiquette and clapping your hands together in a prayer is also important. But, what's more important is..."[skip_next_tag][br]::
41322::$$$message_0276_0003_0000$$$::"Offering money![wvs canskip=0 time=400][say storage=kujifaq_rin_0030b name=凛] You need[wvs canskip=0 time=200][say storage=kujifaq_rin_0030c name=凛][delay speed=1] to[shock vmax=10 time=200 count=2][wait canskip=0 time=200] offer[shock vmax=10 time=200 count=2][wait canskip=0 time=200] money[shock vmax=10 time=200 count=2][wait canskip=0 time=200] no[shock vmax=10 time=200 count=2][wait canskip=0 time=200] matter what[delay speed=user][shock vmax=10 time=200 count=2][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01f(近),071_white][wait canskip=0 time=100][chgfg time=100 storage=凛巫女服01f(近)][movefg opacity=255 left=-44 top=-54 time=100 accel=0 storage=071_white textoff=0][wm canskip=0][se storage=hfse013.wav][shock vmax=20 time=500 count=3][movefg opacity=0 left=-44 top=-54 time=200 accel=0 storage=071_white textoff=0 rule=koyama02r][wm canskip=0]!"::
41323::$$$message_0276_0004_0000$$$::[nr]"The amount of money you possess will be displayed on the bottom left of the screen.[br]Using the money you have, you can buy omikuji, which are slips of paper with random fortunes, and ema, which are wooden plaques that wishes are written on."::
41324::$$$message_0276_0005_0000$$$::"Omikuji is a hundred yen per pull. The fortune ranges from 'very lucky' to 'great misfortune.'"[skip_next_tag][br]::
41325::$$$message_0276_0006_0000$$$::"The topic of the draw includes career, love, studies, travel, lost items, etc.[br]::
41326::$$$message_0276_0006_0001$$$::If you're not satisfied with the results, you can redraw as many times as your budget allows!"[skip_next_tag][br]::
41327::$$$message_0276_0007_0000$$$::"...Although it's debatable whether it would be worth doing so many times."::
41328::$$$message_0276_0008_0000$$$::"The price of each ema varies.[br]It will show the price if you hover the cursor over the ema, so you should discuss with your wallet and choose."[skip_next_tag][br]::
41329::$$$message_0276_0009_0000$$$::"The tachi-e, or standing art, along with model sheets and other images that are used in this fan disc, are drawn on the ema."::
41330::$$$message_0276_0010_0000$$$::"...It seems like there are some very rare and unique things as well.[lr]::
41331::$$$message_0276_0010_0001$$$::You should have an idea of what they might be. The short commentaries that play after every purchase are also a must-see."::
41332::$$$message_0276_0011_0000$$$::"The purchased ema images will be saved under the "Another" tab in the gallery, so you can rest assured that you can take your time looking at them."::
41333::$$$message_0276_0012_0000$$$::"The purchased ema will have a 'paid' mark.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01b(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01b(近)]If you select it again, you can rewatch the short commentary. Your money will not decrease at this time."::
41334::$$$message_0276_0013_0000$$$::"There are only a few ema hung up when the game starts, but they will gradually increase as you travel to different places in Fuyuki City.[cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01c(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01c(近)] Hmm, sneaky."::
41335::$$$message_0276_0014_0000$$$::"There are thirty-eight types of ema in total. Try collecting them if you feel up to it.[lr]::
41336::$$$message_0276_0014_0001$$$::[cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01f(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01f(近)][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=2][se storage=se054.wav]I mean, please do. [wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=2][se storage=se054.wav]With all your might.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01f頬(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01f頬(近)][shock vmax=30 time=600 count=6][se storage=se054.wav]As if to save[se storage=se054.wav] your family!"::
41337::$$$message_0276_0015_0000$$$::"So what happens once you're out of money?[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01c(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01c(近)] ...For those who thought that,[wvl][move textoff=0 opacity=255 storage=048_ピカ cx=79 py=181 px=533 affine=(533,181,-90,1.1,255,79,79)(533,181,-180,1,255,79,79) time=800 cy=79 mag=1 deg=+0.0 accel=-2][se storage=se452.wav][wm canskip=0] you're clever."::
41338::$$$message_0276_0016_0000$$$::"You will start with 500 yen, but you can earn more during the game.[cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01m(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01m(近)] As for how...[wvl][move textoff=0 time=190 path=(122,46,255)(151,23,255)(174,46,255)(151,23,255)(122,46,255)(151,23,255)(174,46,255)(151,23,255) storage=凛巫女服01m(近) accel=0 spline=1] That's a Tohsaka secret![br][wm canskip=0][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01b(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01b(近)][move textoff=0 time=150 path=(151,46,255)(151,23,255)(151,34,255)(151,23,255) storage=凛巫女服01b(近) accel=0]...Well, maybe that's going too far,[wvl][wm canskip=0] so here's a little bonus hint instead."::
41339::$$$message_0276_0017_0000$$$::"There are several ways to increase the amount of money in your possession."::
41340::$$$message_0276_0018_0000$$$::"First off, just get through the story.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01c(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01c(近)]Episodes that are related to money might be your chance!"::
41341::$$$message_0276_0019_0000$$$::"And you can try challenging yourself with completely new Servant games!"::
41342::$$$message_0276_0020_0000$$$::"Also, you might earn money if you are blessed with good luck[cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01c(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01c(近)] too!"::
41343::$$$message_0276_0021_0000$$$::"In those cases, you won't get a notification saying that you've earned any money, I'm afraid.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01b(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01b(近)]For those who are curious, go ahead and pay daily visits to the shrine to check for yourself!"::
41344::$$$message_0276_0022_0000$$$::"Now that's it for the explanation.[br]Thank you for listening. Enjoy your stay."::
41345::$$$message_0276_0023_0000$$$::"...I'm here too."[lr]::

